                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.124a/71: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Carter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-06-07T16:00:00-04:00">June 7, 1930—4
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>55. Reference your No. 68, May 25, noon, last paragraph. Advisory Committee
                    reports that it is sending $2,000 to Campbell today for sanitary relief.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
